1
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:02,669
Hey!

2
00:00:03,044 --> 00:00:03,670
Hey!

3
00:00:03,753 --> 00:00:04,462
Louder!

4
00:00:04,629 --> 00:00:05,629
Hey!

5
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:08,757
Rest for a while!

6
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,010
Rest.

7
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:13,763
God, it's painful.

8
00:00:16,181 --> 00:00:16,891
Jae Seong.

9
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:18,685
You used to collapse
way earlier

10
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:20,395
Your stamina has improved.

11
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,479
Is that so?

12
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:25,942
You will be better if you

13
00:00:26,443 --> 00:00:27,573
keep training like this.

14
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:29,403
Thanks.

15
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:36,077
Individual training again.

16
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:37,244
Leave him alone.

17
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:38,913
He doesn't even listen.

18
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:41,536
He doesn't know what it means
to be a part of a team.

19
00:00:42,709 --> 00:00:43,709
Assemble!

20
00:00:47,338 --> 00:00:48,338
Act quickly.

21
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:50,842
Did you guys train hard?

22
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:51,842
Yes, sir!

23
00:00:53,094 --> 00:00:54,596
No need to train so hard
anymore.

24
00:00:54,763 --> 00:00:55,138
What?

25
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:56,513
What do you mean...

26
00:01:01,102 --> 00:01:02,228
They're cutting our club.

27
00:01:02,228 --> 00:01:03,228
Excuse me?

28
00:01:03,521 --> 00:01:05,315
With fewer members
and bad results

29
00:01:05,315 --> 00:01:06,608
the school's shutting it down.

30
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:08,526
You worked so hard
for so long.

31
00:01:09,527 --> 00:01:10,527
I'm sorry.

32
00:01:10,904 --> 00:01:12,530
If you want
to keep playing baseball

33
00:01:12,781 --> 00:01:14,282
I can help you transfer.

34
00:01:14,657 --> 00:01:15,825
What if we get good results?

35
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,620
I'll make sure

36
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:21,424
we get good results.
